print "Arithmetic Operations Example".

Set a to 10.
Set b to 5.

print "Addition:".
Set result to a + b.
print result.

print "Subtraction:".
Set result to a - b.
print result.

print "Multiplication:".
Set result to a * b.
print result.

print "Division:".
Set result to a / b.
print result.

print "Function with multiple operations:".
Define calculate with parameters x, y:
    Set sum to x + y.
    Set product to x * y.
    Return sum + product.
End definition.

Set result to Call calculate with 3, 4.
print result. 